@startuml
title NutriByte Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User

package "User Interface Layer" as UI {
    component "CLI / JavaFX GUI" as UserInterface
}

package "Service Layer" as Service {
    component "Pantry Operations" as PantryService
}

package "Model Layer" as Model {
    component "Pantry Domain Objects" as DomainModel
}

package "Storage Layer" as Storage {
    component "File Persistence" as PantryStorage
    database "pantry.txt" as PantryFile
}

User --> UserInterface : interacts with
UserInterface --> PantryService : requests operations
PantryService --> DomainModel : creates and updates
PantryService --> PantryStorage : loads and saves
PantryStorage --> PantryFile : reads and writes

note right of UserInterface
Provides the command-line
and JavaFX interfaces.
end note

note right of PantryService
Contains pantry business rules
such as add, consume, search,
filter, edit, and delete.
end note

note right of DomainModel
Represents validated pantry
items and categories.
end note

note right of PantryStorage
Keeps persistence separate
from business logic.
end note

@enduml
